1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:06,031
The Subcommittee on Cyber,
Technology, Weapons and Defence

2
00:00:06,031 --> 00:00:10,112
Industry, under the Senate
Committee on Military

3
00:00:10,112 --> 00:00:14,618
Affairs and State Security,
held Meeting No. 26/2569.

4
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:20,840
Wednesday, 18 November 2026,
at 9.30 a.m.

5
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:26,239
Committee meeting room CA 433,
4th floor, Parliament House.

6
00:00:27,239 --> 00:00:31,468
The subcommittee chair is
Mr. Chaiyong Maneerungskul.

7
00:00:31,548 --> 00:00:35,767
This subcommittee is part of the
Senate Committee on Military

8
00:00:35,767 --> 00:00:39,778
Affairs and State Security,
chaired by Mr. Somboon Nunual.

9
00:00:40,779 --> 00:00:44,619
The meeting studied ways to
promote the defence industry.

10
00:00:44,699 --> 00:00:49,051
It received information, facts
and views on key issues:

11
00:00:49,131 --> 00:00:51,300
an overview of the defence industry,

12
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:56,418
urgent matters that need the
government to push and promote them,

13
00:00:56,498 --> 00:00:58,239
legal obstacles,

14
00:00:58,319 --> 00:01:00,356
and problems and
obstacles in operations.

15
00:01:00,436 --> 00:01:04,279
It also heard suggestions
from the agencies concerned.

16
00:01:05,279 --> 00:01:09,658
The subcommittee invited representatives
of government agencies to attend,

17
00:01:09,738 --> 00:01:13,959
including the Defence
Industry and Energy Center,

18
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:13,959
the Customs Department,

19
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:15,399
the Department of
Provincial Administration,

20
00:01:15,479 --> 00:01:17,739
the Department of Public Works
and Town & Country Planning,

21
00:01:17,819 --> 00:01:18,979
the Department of Industrial Works,

22
00:01:19,059 --> 00:01:22,501
the Office of the National
Higher Education, Science,

23
00:01:22,501 --> 00:01:25,033
Research and Innovation Policy Council,

24
00:01:25,114 --> 00:01:26,319
the Department of Intellectual Property,

25
00:01:26,399 --> 00:01:29,814
the Office of the Board of Investment,

26
00:01:29,894 --> 00:01:32,287
the Defence Technology Institute,

27
00:01:32,367 --> 00:01:39,439
the Office of the National Broadcasting
and Telecommunications Commission,

28
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:43,859
and the Office of the National
Anti-Corruption Commission.

29
00:01:44,859 --> 00:01:49,879
The meeting exchanged views on
the defence industry ecosystem,

30
00:01:49,959 --> 00:01:53,659
covering policy, laws,
regulations, investment, research

31
00:01:53,659 --> 00:01:57,094
and development, production,
and government support.

32
00:01:57,175 --> 00:02:01,234
The information and views received
will be used in its study

33
00:02:01,234 --> 00:02:04,548
and in recommendations to
the agencies concerned,

34
00:02:04,629 --> 00:02:08,510
to drive the development
of the defence industry

35
00:02:08,510 --> 00:02:11,178
in a systematic and concrete way.

36
00:02:12,179 --> 00:02:18,499
In the last six months, up to this
meeting, the subcommittee met 15 times.

37
00:02:19,499 --> 00:02:21,954
This summary is based
on the subcommittee's

38
00:02:21,954 --> 00:02:23,438
published meeting summary.

39
00:02:23,519 --> 00:02:26,510
Meeting minutes and reports
are available through

40
00:02:26,510 --> 00:02:29,318
the channels of the
Secretariat of the Senate.

